{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_06_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f99fb026db7f8802139c8d2d17afb4d87a85eed9d24e47aa814601466bfe43e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea08d01bdd9630c078b8222af9b3812255ff1852a9194c56245dc0136def692",
      "text": "志狼君、花音君。\n虽然很遗憾，但接下的工作还是竭尽全力去完成吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d46c4970eb3114b3adf219753cd391d96033c54a82853dcd77ddd3df9b6e2c9f",
      "text": "练习的时间虽然不多，\n正式演出时或许不会太顺利……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:637b32a1e6c72ddf695b6edc4681e79880d7b7bcd71d120d155ad03bea7da3ff",
      "text": "但315 Production的大家，\n为了这次比赛一直努力到了现在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:030459733a097a8866882c22099e981b0ec6217a6530bb2bbb059c27ae6ba2d6",
      "text": "もふもふえん也要为了315 Pro、\n还有粉丝大家一起努力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f8f460abb252f8fed3002aa2d788479f091c6e17938e6f80957e5328fc83c1f",
      "text": "直央……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abefaa3f9b092f83d3b2ec0bd280a7608b5e6af6a43e296163af96a1d41352d6",
      "text": "也是呢。因为还有人给我们发消息说，\n“好期待もふもふえん的表演！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c60613acc1de038d22e0246ef6ce6a089317b7f74a5dfce66411af296d0a7857",
      "text": "要是听说我们不演了，一定会很失望的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cd82029edcc807d8e7a69545861e934ea9afc8791de1cdc7b7113064acdfa04",
      "text": "但是啊……要是演得不好\n让人家失望了怎么办啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61dd69aaf735c8b745d3d4d7d74214d654a9ccc8ff8902009e749fcfaf847626",
      "text": "到那时候，下一次，\n我们315 Production大家再一起努力就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ebdee0aaf3af1ea7372bf346c1c7f2d5eaeb44348a40d074e64e538d1d4a372",
      "text": "只要全员齐心协力，无论发生什么都能克服的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a03d81e481e1a9e45e9fd61ad6eb4eda08e22d74ec5d979cee67e01159117683",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……\n说得也是啊。是我太泄气了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a8a3074b57e47778c8b5a0d59a60444abc435e21b9f72cb4ec5bfa747ffa1a4",
      "text": "我们这边，可是有超级多的同伴呢。\n这点小事，根本不算什么！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000126:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000133:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01128a88011d56529bac4398ca8297fa84821424717cbeb6fc2ba08330c5d7df",
      "text": "练习休息的时候\n聊到的那件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000135:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5f82ada0cb896f9d7f328b5766ab0acec8dfb7d9939ce05551e4d4fe61ec0eb",
      "text": "两个人同时说的台词，\n我觉得还是卡好节奏配合一下\n会比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000137:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecd1c21d2b251074d24daa27de4e03c5202d048e2d482dcca5ffff457ac3cb2c",
      "text": "我也这么觉得！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000139:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33af22f796488ba82d2faaa5f4731ba10135c7c03a8764c5aa9fd7ad366ea6a7",
      "text": "我们的角色虽然\n性格各不相同，\n但毕竟是兄弟对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000141:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:285c1e0faf6f7d8371d0fc245ca488944abe0f3aa3077fab38097c88c527af5d",
      "text": "既然是兄弟的话\n节奏完全一致才对嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000143:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:252d28c5c0375f3b1e3105dda50234c85091eb7a093f5bc46cd0068cf7e59653",
      "text": "花音也赞成！\n明天的练习时\n大家一起试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000145:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19262032b6645f7cc3965ebe928265006c03e4359472d0de7f0c38ec3cad434b",
      "text": "制作人也是，\n要是有什么注意到的地方\n请告诉我们哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_17</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000147:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a3e713f13c252452c90a0003af6e8df6b7db6b60f36a41f4d1260909358f2e",
      "text": "好的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000147:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646566900ce2533b9b579f724d2d523dc0c83f55d40a3ad3663ef3f4acdd1b4c",
      "text": "好的。\n我会再仔细\n看看视频的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000148:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e224e5ff9f4911779e873714c0298e26c9ee244edb0a9a7a69d762a5d9a9631",
      "text": "交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000148:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11f5a6111c532cd280458bc903605c11dd01723d7fab480b4502b754f9ab2024",
      "text": "交给我吧！\n明天也请多多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000152:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c92699d340911a92e1ad8632d1dd6b15c3ee19a31cae3b601bb48d73c82c5037",
      "text": "谢谢！\n那么，明天见啦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000154:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32cc2b0dc1ad5cf4aba5473fb1b4f4e18de52770c6de2e61bd9bf3cb245c930b",
      "text": "我说啊，直央",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000156:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:899828233503335e2e3cf2cd07bbd13bb5d909474a78109ccce8ccf54ef1f995",
      "text": "今天稍微\n有点帅气呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_f:cmd-000158:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce4a94c513d25ae846c5b4c2dcca7bea4f0f7eeaa65833efe5660eefcb27004b",
      "text": "就这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
